---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — Astro Wild Child" noindex>
  <section class="container-awc py-24">
    <div class="max-w-prose mx-auto">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose-awc mx-0">
        <p><em>Placeholder — to be replaced with final policy.</em></p>
        <p>Astro Wild Child ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This page explains what we collect, how we use it, and your rights.</p>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Newsletter subscription: email address, provided by you.</li>
          <li>Booking data: name, email, and details provided via Calendly.</li>
          <li>Contact form submissions: name, email, and message.</li>
          <li>Anonymous analytics (page views, referrer). No personal profiling.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>To respond to you, send you the newsletter you signed up for, and improve the site. We never sell your data.</p>
        <h2>Third parties</h2>
        <p>Calendly (bookings), MailerLite (newsletter). Both have their own privacy policies.</p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can unsubscribe from any email at any time, or write to <a href="mailto:hello@astrowildchild.com">hello@astrowildchild.com</a> to have your data deleted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
